            "detailed_description": "Wolf Gang is a tactical turn based game where you play as a band of wolves as they make their way around the mountain, pursuing their territorial aspirations while fighting other animals. The combat revolves around a unique rule set that puts the tides of advantage constantly in flux. Knock outs are only temporary, and the traditional rock-paper-scissors strength and weakness hierarchy is subverted with a system of constantly rotating attunements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Accessible pick-up-and-play puzzle game-play<br>    </li><li>Story driven single player campaign<br>    </li><li>Additional challenges for completionists<br>    </li><li>Tons of unlockables and character customization</li></ul>",
